skill: opencreator
version: 1.0.0
source: https://github.com/krillinai/OpenCreator
upstream_commit: b01a9f71165b9010216e25c462653b0cfa33cbce
category: creative-media/video
interface: desktop
purpose: Operate the named Codex CLI-based OpenCreator workspace across Desktop, CLI, Server, Skills/MCP/schedules, creator runs, source checks, and troubleshooting.
routes:
  - code-first video pipeline -> video-production
  - long-form clipping -> autoclip
  - local timeline editing -> opencut
  - general Skill authoring -> skill-standardization
safety:
  - approval before download, installer, source dependencies, provider linking, credentials, paid generation, credit purchase, MCP/schedule activation, external publication, network exposure, or deletion
  - never read or print credential files; no automatic paid retries
  - use pinned upstream reference and release-matched checksums
  - source preflight is offline/read-only and always reports runtime_verified=false
paths:
  - orient
  - install
  - configure
  - creator-task
  - skills-mcp
  - source-work
  - troubleshoot
files:
  - SKILL.md
  - references/upstream.md
  - scripts/preflight.py
  - evals/evals.json
  - scripts/test_opencreator_preflight.py
